<title>HONG KONG: KLTCB sets A$125 mln bond.</title>
<headline>KLTCB sets A$125 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p>BORROWER KOREA LONG TERM CREDIT BANK</p>
<p> AMT	A$125 MLN     COUPON    7.10     MATURITY 1 YR &amp; 1 DAY</p>
<p> TYPE     EUROBOND	ISS PRICE 99.96    PAY DATE  23.SEPT.96</p>
<p> MOODY    A3		REOFFER   99.96    LAUNCH    12.SEPT.96</p>
<p> S&amp;P	A-		YIELD     7.14     DENOMS    A$1 MLN</p>
<p> LISTING  LONDON	  SPREAD BILLS+15BP  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>SALE LMT US/UK/HK/AUS/KOREA</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	     CRS DEFLT YES	FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> FULL FEE 0.046	   MGT/UND   0.03     SELL CONC 0.016</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH	 HOME CTRY S.KOREA</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGERS HSBC MARKETS</p>
<p> NOTE     EUROBOND ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAM</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
